// McDonald's public-domain translation (1996), checked line by line against
// James Legge's (1891) and the Chinese Wang Bi text. Each chapter is its own
// text: a Ziran literal holds up to 4 KB.
TAO_TE_CHING_TITLE :: "Tao Te Ching"
TAO_TE_CHING_CHAPTERS :: 81

